<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan CK group to tender for 108,000T U.S. corn.</title>
<headline>Taiwan CK group to tender for 108,000T U.S. corn.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's CK group will tender on Wednesday for two 54,000-tonne shipments of U.S. No.2 corn, traders said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The CK Group comprises Chia Hsin Flour Feed and Vegetable Oil Corp and some buyers from Taiwan's southern port city of Kaohsiung.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follows:</p>
<p>Shipment  Tonnes  Date/Location</p>
<p>			 U.S. Gulf    Pacific Northwest</p>
<p>   One     54,000  Sept 5-20    Sept 21-Oct 5</p>
<p>   Two     54,000  Oct 5-20     Oct 21-Nov 5</p>
<p>-- Taipei newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
